<title>NORWAY: Norway expands 4-mnth t-bill by 2.0 bln NOK.</title>
<headline>Norway expands 4-mnth t-bill by 2.0 bln NOK.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank said on Thursday the Finance Ministry was expanding the SS46 treasury bill by 2.0 billion crowns through an ordinary auction.</p>
<p>Final date for tenders was set at 0900gmt on March 3.</p>
<p>The t-bill was issued on January 16 at 12.5 billion crowns of which the central bank reserved 500 million crowns for itself.</p>
<p>The t-bill has a nominal interest rate of 3.50 percent and matures on May 20.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
